The residual drift is real but should not trigger indiscriminate surgery. Sentence SD is less than half the selected target even though both tail shares are healthy, which means the middle and long sentences do not range as widely as the formula describes. FRE 94.0 and grade 3.59 show substantially simpler diction/syllable texture than the requested crossover register. The grade nevertheless meets the coordinator's current working floor and strongly serves the thirteen-year-old gate. Any calibration should be selective, human-read, and confined to calm explanatory prose; the dialogue, landing beats, protected text, and successful stampede should not be lengthened merely to chase decimals.

