editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-002.md:33:The second morning after the wall (day 51). Teague's crew went out at the previous dawn on the cold road and is a week away. [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit A2] The five are thirteenth of thirteen with about ten marks, sleeping in the meadow. Nobody is hurt. Karis holds one word, *stillhound*, underlined.
