editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/STATE_LEDGER.md:74:| 6 | Shadow-adjacent (Bronze) | Seln (B4 Ch13) | Integrated; **sealed** | Presence-suppression and movement-masking. **Costs from waking; drifts at dusk.** Sealed from any witness who could carry it west (a defector's tradecraft in his hands would burn its source). **Book 7 uses it exactly twice:** the Ring (ten strides; circle and Oryn only) and the Stair ascent (unseen) |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/STATE_LEDGER.md:78:| — | Tide-adjacent anomaly | B2 Ch19 (session nine) | **Not a fragment; not counted** | "Still open. Still real. Patience." Inventories only until the tenth fragment exists |
