editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/STATE_LEDGER.md:96:| Oryn | Tide; Iron R4 (PROVISIONAL) | — | — | **Not met.** First on the page on day 80 (M3) |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/STATE_LEDGER.md:98:**Who knows the mechanism:** Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln. Nobody else. Oryn becomes the sixth on day 100.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/STATE_LEDGER.md:110:| Teague, Pike, Oryn | No | Day 9 (Pike), day 49 (Teague), day 80 (Oryn) |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/STATE_LEDGER.md:121:- **No weapons of note** beyond knives, Brom's bill-hook and Lira's long knife. **No crossbow** until Oryn hands hers to Brom at the Ring's stone (day 96).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-001.md:13:**Read before drafting:** Book 6 `chapter-23.md`, `chapter-24.md` (the seam); B7 source `chapter-01.md`, `chapter-02.md`; `BOOK_MAP.md` §1 (entry), §5 (cutaway rules), §7 (the hold; no deployment), §9, §10 (Ch1–2 items), §12 C1; `STATE_LEDGER.md`; `universe/UNIVERSE_BIBLE.md` (Edge Territories; Edge Fauna).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-001.md:25:- **Lowmarch, day 9, and the board read like the Cinder House board.** Fourteen slips, not one pricing the crew. Pike: sixties, one arm, "Copper, Force, thirty years on the roads." "Walk, carry, climb, fight." / "In that order?" / "Depends on the day." A heading opened with five names and five columns: Job, Hirer, Witness, Outcome, Price. No tier column. He reads it upside down and looks for the missing column "the way you look for a stair in the dark, with a foot."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-001.md:38:- The stillhound's sense is **unknown** in this movement. Karis has the word, not the mechanism; the discharge finding belongs to M2. Nobody hears the words *quiet ground*. No healer, no Tide practitioner, no Oryn.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:10:- Formula load: progression vocabulary ≈50 per 10k (the line's mechanics as trials: Arbiter, sigil, declaration, render). ≈18 growth beats. Supporting beats for all five, plus Oryn, Pike, Teague, Ephram, Vell.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:16:Oxhollow's bank at dusk on the 84th: a hundred and sixteen in hand, and six owed. Ribs taped, the calf bound, Lira's leg new and her right boot gone. Oryn is walking north; Teague's crew has crossed south. Nine days to Thornwater.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:26:- **Thornwater, day 93:** Oryn on the bench at the gate with a carter's hand; "Fifteen days. Since the break." / "Breath stops at it." / "Ninth day. I said nine. You've counted." Her **two reasons** (a patient whole and still for the long reading; the carters' claim about a healer's hands, never checked); "You're a stop. I've added you… Don't make it a long stop." Her table that evening, seen from the loft door.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:27:- **Days 94–95, six on the Fallow road** (Oryn on the mule's down-slope side; the registry sheet goes back into the box at the east gate; past Thornwater's fork the printed sheet is white). **The rise:** he looks at the dark place where an Arbiter would be. Lira's hand up: "It's like the air got thick." Brom: "Like a door closing behind me." Oryn's hands half-raised and silent. Karis: "My Arbiter's gone." Seln: "Back up. Ten paces. Tell me when it comes back." Five *backs* at one stride. The stone. **Cael felt nothing, either way, and says nothing**, for two reasons: he doesn't know what it means, and nobody asked. The log at the stone (protected). Camp on the road, no fire. The floor takes the last light like water, and Oryn holds her hands over the line until it's gone.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:28:- **Day 96, the perimeter (≈4,000, measured set piece):** procedure said once (Lira the instrument a stride inside; Karis on the line with the cord; Brom marking; Seln ahead; Oryn at the stone; Cael writing counts). The bend in Karis's wrist; **iron at the third cord**; sixty-two cords and twenty strides; ten cords to the middle; "A circle is a made shape." said once as geometry and not followed. **The stake**: registry stamp, thirty-one, a boot's width on the line, "Five years in the weather. A winter either side."; "You drive them where you've measured to."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:29:- **The trials at the stone:** Lira's full burst becomes a step ("It's in me. It's not in the air."; the clock line); Brom's "Skin."; Karis sees every point and can fill none ("It costs nothing. There's nothing to spend."); Seln vanishes for a breath without his Path ("It was never most of what I do."); **Oryn's three crossings** with Brom's arm in her hands ("Nothing in my hands" / "A healer's hands stop working there."). **Cael's two private tests:** the Iron read released before the stride, running across it; at twenty strides a foot's worth of Wind evasion round a stone. From behind it is a man stepping. "It was dark before. It's dark now." Both halves true; together not the truth.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:30:- **Six over; the site catalogued** (eleven uprights broken at eleven heights; floor twenty-six strides; level under the cord; seamless under his palms, written only as "no seam"; the lip; Karis's chips don't match; the bands "None I own…"). **No instruments anywhere.** **The den** under the far lip (fresh prints; bones in one clause; scat; a hollow worn smooth). "They live in here because nothing that walks in can fight." Everyone looks at the line and the sun, then at Oryn, then at him. The log at the far lip (protected).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:37:- Oryn reads nobody inside. She has now crossed (with Brom and with the six); her eight solo crossings are M5's.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:38:- No stillhound is seen; it is all sign. The movement ends at dusk at the far lip, about to move.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/BOOK_MAP.md:18:- **Party: FIVE.** Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln. Book 6's cards counted six. Book 6's prose settled on five ("the sixth" is Seln's empty desk). Six only after Oryn.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/BOOK_MAP.md:19:- **Cael:** eighteen (turned on the page in B6 Ch14). **Nine confirmed fragments + the Tide-adjacent anomaly** (session nine, B2), uncounted, under the standing words "Still open. Still real. Patience." No injury open (the Crown-yard forearm bruise is a week from gone; the eleven-minute bill was paid on the road east). The Power Log is in Hesk's satchel, about a third of its leaves left.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/BOOK_MAP.md:30:- **Where/when:** Lowmarch in first snow on the 129th day past the Line. The ferry's last run on the 130th. Oryn's letter by carter on the morning of the 131st. Book 8 Ch1 opens on the 131st.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/BOOK_MAP.md:31:- **Cael:** **nineteen** (turned on the page on the 102nd, at Thornwater). **Ten confirmed fragments.** The tenth is **Tide-adjacent** (Oryn; partial; Iron; self and contact; *Engagement: clinical — non-hostile*), acquired on the 100th. The anomaly is now **a location, not an entry: the still place.** It was read three times. It does not flow and does not change, and everything goes around it. It is not the Quiet and not a fragment. Not touched since a healer said *stop*. Ribs quiet again since the marsh. Calf a closed seam.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/BOOK_MAP.md:32:- **The rule on the tenth, in Oryn's hand and his:** *ask first, every time.* It was paid once, by not reading Teague.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/BOOK_MAP.md:33:- **Lira:** left forearm bitten through at the Ring, mended at the line, reopened on the Stair and closed again. **Still slung and under Oryn's order at first snow** ("She'll say when"). Right ankle taped and **never mended in this book.** Carries Oryn's crossbow on its strap (hers from the Hall, Ch21).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/BOOK_MAP.md:37:- **Oryn:** at Thornwater on her route, **three weeks late there** and the route whole. Letter: "Six, by letter." She learned the mechanism on the 100th. She has not heard any theory, because there is none.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/BOOK_MAP.md:38:- **Who knows the mechanism:** six (Oryn added). Teague, Pike, the holds and the faceless faction do not.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/pre-B6-reconciliation/BOOK_MAP.md:42:- **Objects:** the kit (case, pacing cord knotted at the fives, stake thirty-two with the stroke-and-bar mark and a bright point, mallet); the ledger; the 52 sheets; the map; **two brass straightedges** (Ternhall's; Hesk's, arrived on the last ferry). Both touch the three paced centres without daylight, **in Cael's hand as in anyone's** (Book 8 Ch1 owns the first hair of error). Also three boxes, Seln's case, one mule (the crew's), and Oryn's crossbow with one bolt left in it.
