editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/B6-RECONCILIATION-APPLIED.md:220:### BM:269 — Ch24 Oryn's letter
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/B6-RECONCILIATION-APPLIED.md:225:- **Oryn's letter (Ch24):** *Route's whole. The knee held. Nobody died of three weeks. Spring: bring the map, and lie still when I say. — O.* — then: Six, by letter. (The architecture and series docs still quote "eleven days"; prose and Book 8 say **three weeks**. See C6.)
