editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-003/plan-audit.md:3:The movement's architecture, calendar, injuries, money, fragment count, and protected documents hold. Repair is local: make explicit that Lira's declaration—not her body—crosses the gorge; state Drawn Channel's eight-pace join limit on Karis's road-scale lattice; restore the packet's partly quoted “Cold” unit from the source; preserve “derived, not tested” on the correct methodological ground; put the packet's Tide axiom on the page; remove the information Oryn gives Teague beyond what Oxhollow's yard can show him; and locate the inherited ash wedge instead of losing it by implication (`manuscript/chapter-19.md:43-49,125-129`; `manuscript/chapter-20.md:35-37,211`; `manuscript/chapter-20.md:229-235`; `manuscript/chapter-21.md:31-35,341-343`; `manuscript/chapter-22.md:159-179,247-251`; `packets/MOVEMENT-003.md:41,45,51-55`). No structural rewrite, reorder, new scene, or protected-document duplication is required.
