  estimate for when he is whole, and fix "a week" or the days she adds so the promise is possible.
  Keep the weight of making six gates wait, and that curiosity has become a want.

## Light pass (bounded)

### F. Register in calm explanatory narration (editorial 3)
While you are in ch15:53–97, ch17:97–263 and ch21:213–297, keep or build a few fuller, clearly
ordered sentences and use the exact trade word where it is already natural. Do not inflate
dialogue, action or protected lines, and do not chase a figure. Measure once at the end.
Hold: mean 13.3–14.2, ≥40-word share ≤ 4.5%, 850–1,050 words per scene.

## Constraints
- Reader Standard; Monroe 1.3 voice; O'Connor controls. No new named characters.
- Season-blind; feet, yards, paces, strides; no year count since Kindling; Cael is eighteen and
