+### F. Calm explanatory register — RESOLVED
+
+The bounded pass is visible in exact trade and research language without inflating action or protected units: `The first was the plainest`; `She took her station`; `The first observation was the spacing`; and `the archivist ... and the researcher`. The binding holds all pass: sentence mean 14.04 (13.3–14.2), sentences of forty or more words 4% (maximum 4.5%), and 918.8 words per scene (850–1,050).
